& [ExactBoundary]
  + transport.zip is temporary local transport material and is not retained evidence
  + after remote status passed transport.zip must be absent before pilot_receipt.json a8_replay_1.stdout.json a8_replay_2.stdout.json and final_audit.json join the already retained preflight.json
  + the independent verifier continues to require exactly those five files and refuses every extra file

& [FailureCleanup]
  + the outer finally remains responsible for deleting transport.zip when transfer install replay or evidence retrieval fails
  + deletion targets only the exact generated archive beneath the run-specific governed local evidence directory

& [Preservation]
  + package bytes manifest source commit remote root protected roots provider state replay semantics receipt shape and all authority locks are unchanged

& [Invalidation]
  + verifying while transport.zip exists admitting it as evidence or weakening the five-file exact-membership rule invalidates the pilot
